# Greasewrench Goblin (2/1, "Exhaust - {2}{R}: Discard up to two cards, then draw that many cards. Put a +1/+1 counter on this
# creature"): Bot1 casts it on turn 1 and on turn 3 pays the exhaust cost with the three Moxen. With Swamp, Island and the Plains it drew in hand, choosing all
# three cards is refused (up to two); discarding the Swamp and the Island draws the next two cards, Mox Pearl and Mox Emerald. The counter comes
# either way (3/2), and on turn 5 the exhaust ability is not offered again with every source untapped.

